@api = http://localhost:5080/api/v1/pdf

### Plantillas disponibles y motores que las aceptan
GET {{api}}/templates

### Datos de ejemplo de una plantilla
GET {{api}}/templates/factura/sample

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Factura con cada motor (misma plantilla factura, mismos parametros)
### ?inline=true la abre en el navegador en lugar de descargarla
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1. iTextSharp LGPL (HtmlWorker)
POST {{api}}/itext?inline=true
Content-Type: application/json

< ./Templates/requests/factura.request.json

### 2. QuestPDF 2022.12 (plantilla en C#)
POST {{api}}/questpdf?inline=true
Content-Type: application/json

< ./Templates/requests/factura.request.json

### 3. Scriban + HtmlRenderer.PdfSharp
POST {{api}}/htmlrenderer?inline=true
Content-Type: application/json

< ./Templates/requests/factura.request.json

### 4. PuppeteerSharp (Chromium)
POST {{api}}/puppeteer?inline=true
Content-Type: application/json

< ./Templates/requests/factura.request.json

### 5. Microsoft.Playwright (Chromium)
POST {{api}}/playwright?inline=true
Content-Type: application/json

< ./Templates/requests/factura.request.json

### 6. PDF base + texto superpuesto
POST {{api}}/overlay?inline=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "template": "certificado",
  "page": { "orientation": "Landscape" },
  "data": {
    "nombre": "Juan Pérez Andrade",
    "curso": "Arquitectura de Software en .NET 10",
    "horas": 40,
    "fecha": "27 de septiembre de 2026",
    "instructor": "María López",
    "codigo": "CERT-2026-000123"
  }
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### HTML en linea (plantilla Scriban enviada en la solicitud)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{api}}/playwright?inline=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "html": "<div style='display:flex;gap:16px;font-family:Arial'>{{ for k in kpis }}<div style='flex:1;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;background:#1f4e79;color:#fff'><div style='font-size:12px'>{{ k.nombre }}</div><div style='font-size:28px;font-weight:bold'>{{ k.valor }}</div></div>{{ end }}</div>",
  "data": { "kpis": [ { "nombre": "Ventas", "valor": "$ 1.2M" }, { "nombre": "Clientes", "valor": "3.480" }, { "nombre": "Pedidos", "valor": "12.905" } ] },
  "page": { "size": "A4", "orientation": "Landscape", "marginMm": 10 },
  "fileName": "kpis"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Plantilla Word con MiniWord + MiniPdf (en proceso, sin Gotenberg)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### Word (.docx) rellenado por MiniWord
POST http://localhost:5080/api/v1/minipdf/docx
Content-Type: application/json

< ./Templates/requests/factura.request.json

### PDF convertido con MiniPdf
POST http://localhost:5080/api/v1/minipdf/pdf?inline=true
Content-Type: application/json

< ./Templates/requests/factura.request.json

### Vista previa del HTML combinado (depurar plantillas)
POST {{api}}/preview-html
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "template": "factura",
  "data": { "numero": "001", "empresa": { "nombre": "Demo" }, "items": [] }
}
